    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 18 Renville Village is an impressive detached residence occupying a prime position at the front of this highly regarded coastal development. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this is the largest house type within Renville Village and offers bright, spacious accommodation ideally suited to both permanent and holiday home use.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a generously proportioned living/dining room, kitchen breakfast room, utility room, guest WC and a ground floor double bedroom with ensuite. Upstairs, there are two further large double bedrooms, one with en suite and walk in wardrobe and the main bathroom. The principal bedroom also benefits from a balcony overlooking the front of the property, while a substantial hot press provides excellent storage space.\n\nRenville Village enjoys a scenic setting close to Galway Bay, Renville Park and a host of outdoor and leisure amenities. Oranmore Village is just a short drive away, offering an excellent range of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and public transport links. The development is also conveniently located near the newly renovated 5 star Hawthorn Hotel & Golf Resort and Galway Bay Sailing Club. Combining a superb location, generous accommodation and excellent presentation throughout, No. 18 is a rare opportunity to acquire one of if not thee finest home within the development.\n\nGarden\n\nTo the front, the property benefits from private off-street parking and a prominent position within the development, vehicle access down the side which is gated. The rear garden features a paved patio area and lawn, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and relaxation. Bordered by mature trees, the garden enjoys a high degree of privacy and excellent ."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nLarge spacious entry, tiled porch. laminate floor through to inner hallway, coving, under stairs storage and carpet on stairs, side aspect window.\n\nWC: - \nTiled floor, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror & light, side aspect window.\n\nLiving Room: - \nLarge bright room with triple aspect, laminate timber floor, coving, built in entertainment unit, bay window, recess lighting, solid fuel stove.\n\nKitchen Breakfast Room: - \nLaminate timber floor, coving, wall & floor kitchen units, tiled splashback, kitchen island, gas hob, Electrolux double oven,built in dishwasher dishwasher, side aspect window, slide doors access rear garden, side aspect window.\n\nUtility Room: - \nTiled floor, built in storage, rear aspect window, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet flooring, coving, built in wardrobe & vanity, front aspect window.\n\nEn Suite: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, mirror & light, shower unit, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet on floor, built in wardrobe & vanity, rear aspect window, access to main bathroom.\n\nBathroom: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror & light, heated towel rail, bath, shower mixer tap, seperate shower unit, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet on floor, access to balcony, eaves storage.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe: - \nCarpet on floor, built in shelving, clothes rails & drawers, eaves sotrage.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin with vanity, mirror & light, heated towel rail, shower, dual skylights.\n\nHot Press: - \nCarpet on floor, shelved, hot water tank.\n\n"
      },
